nction maps elements from a set to the values $0$ or $1,$ depending on whether the element belongs to a specified subset. The indicator function is designed to \"indicate\" whether an element is a member of a subset.\n\nMore specifically, consider a universal set $X.$ Then, the indicator function of a set $A⊆X$ is the function\n\n$$\n{1}_{A}(x)={\\begin{aligned}1, & \\text{if }x\\in A, \\\\ 0, & \\text{if }x\\notin A.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe indicator function of the set ${m,r,t}$ is shown below.\n\n![](images/1f/1fd2100d57c3483e737dc40298d4d5f61099ebc2863c54839906b66183acf576.png)\n\n \n\nNotice that the elements $m,r$ and $t$ (the elements of our subset) are mapped to $1,$ and all other elements are mapped to $0.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-3c4bea35-db14-526a-a533-f1c203bb2ae0"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-3c4bea35-db14-526a-a533-f1c203bb2ae0" :answer-field/id #uuid "3c4bea35-db14-526a-a533-f1c203bb2ae0" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-133bd8dc-2c5b-5e1b-bfb2-e4928c76cb5e" :answer-field/choices ["answer-68af38a9-4172-580e-b666-d3cbc1377bf4" "answer-133bd8dc-2c5b-5e1b-bfb2-e4928c76cb5e" "answer-065f51d0-87f5-5d0a-beff-e1ffeb43d4fd" "answer-03fbd85f-b443-5e0c-9c2a-949a37212341" "answer-fe62726e-5545-5152-8439-a9f4dd17bb4a"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-68af38a9-4172-580e-b666-d3cbc1377bf4" :answer/id #uuid "68af38a9-4172-580e-b666-d3cbc1377bf4" :answer/type :answer.type/image :answer/value "images/41/41937d29a553f82e3f40c698773ab7f87c7743c16c6ee74fe23ed4edd74fe226.png" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-133bd8dc-2c5b-5e1b-bfb2-e4928c76cb5e" :answer/id #uuid "133bd8dc-2c5b-5e1b-bfb2-e4928c76cb5e" :answer/type :answer.type/image :answer/value "images/42/428dbace9da052a9a308996f661f17249c72798f72d7aff416e82e2a747860ba.png" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-065